@startuml
!include style.puml

actor "Benutzer-Skript\n(Python)" as UserScript

rectangle "mypalletizer API (Python >= 3.12)" as API {
    component "Robot API" as RobotAPI
    component "World API" as WorldAPI
}

node "Unity Simulation (C# / PhysX)" as UnityNode {
    component "UnityUdpBridge\n(:5005)" as RobotBridge
    component "WorldUdpBridge\n(:5006)" as WorldBridge
}

node "MyPalletizer 260 M5 (ESP32)" as RobotHardware {
    component "Firmware Serial Driver\n(115200 Baud)" as SerialDriver
}

UserScript --> RobotAPI : In-Process Methodenaufruf\n(send_angles, pump_on, etc.)
UserScript --> WorldAPI : In-Process Methodenaufruf\n(spawn, delete, clear, etc.)

RobotAPI --> RobotBridge : UDP / JSON (Port 5005)\nRoboterkanal
WorldAPI --> WorldBridge : UDP / JSON (Port 5006)\nWeltkanal

RobotAPI --> SerialDriver : USB / Serial (115200 Baud)\nvia pymycobot
SerialDriver --> RobotAPI : Telemetrie-Antwort\n(get_angles)

@enduml
